---
import LegalLayout from '../layouts/LegalLayout.astro';
import ContactEmail from '../components/ContactEmail.astro';
import { SITE } from '../config/site';
---
<LegalLayout
  title="Terms of Use — 1RMHub"
  h1="Terms of Use"
  description="The terms for using 1RMHub's free one rep max calculators and guides: estimates only, no warranty, and responsible use."
  path="/terms/"
  name="Terms of Use"
>
  <p>
    By using {SITE.name} (the &ldquo;site&rdquo;) you agree to these terms. If you do not agree, please
    do not use the site.
  </p>

  <h2>What the site provides</h2>
  <p>
    The site provides free calculators and educational content about strength training. All
    calculator results are <strong>estimates</strong> from published formulas. They are not tested
    maximums, not guarantees of performance, and not medical, health or professional coaching
    advice. Please read the <a href="/disclaimer/">disclaimer</a>.
  </p>

  <h2>Your responsibility</h2>
  <p>
    You are responsible for how you use the information on this site, including any decision to
    lift a particular weight. Strength training — especially maximal lifting — carries a risk of
    injury. Use proper technique, suitable equipment and supervision, and consult a qualified
    professional if you have any health concerns.
  </p>

  <h2>No warranty</h2>
  <p>
    We work hard to keep the calculations and content accurate, but the site is provided
    &ldquo;as is&rdquo; and &ldquo;as available&rdquo;, without warranties of any kind, express or implied,
    including accuracy, fitness for a particular purpose and uninterrupted availability.
  </p>

  <h2>Limitation of liability</h2>
  <p>
    To the fullest extent permitted by law, {SITE.name} and its operator are not liable for any
    injury, loss or damage arising from your use of, or reliance on, the site or its results.
    Nothing in these terms limits liability that cannot be limited under applicable law.
  </p>

  <h2>Acceptable use</h2>
  <p>
    You may use the site for personal, non-commercial purposes and may share links to it. Please
    do not attempt to disrupt the site, overload it with automated requests, or copy substantial
    parts of its content to republish as your own.
  </p>

  <h2>Intellectual property</h2>
  <p>
    The site&rsquo;s text, design and code are © {SITE.name}. The 1RM formulas themselves are
    published works by their respective authors and are credited on each page. Brief quotations with
    a link back are welcome.
  </p>

  <h2>External links</h2>
  <p>
    The site links to third-party sources for reference. We are not responsible for their content
    or availability.
  </p>

  <h2>Changes</h2>
  <p>
    We may update these terms from time to time. The date at the top shows the latest version.
    Continued use of the site after a change means you accept the updated terms.
  </p>

  <h2>Contact</h2>
  <p>Questions about these terms: <ContactEmail />.</p>
</LegalLayout>
